WEBVTT

00:00.480 --> 00:05.960
Come with me to reinforce the east gate the Wuzhao have been besieging three sides, leaving one open now north and west are under attack.

00:06.040 --> 00:10.920
But the east is quiet they're likely waiting for us to move the east garrison to reinforce elsewhere.

00:11.360 --> 00:14.480
Then attack the east let's go we're going to the east.

00:14.600 --> 00:15.640
Yes.

00:18.000 --> 00:26.500
You rushed with your men to the East Gate. After guarding it on high alert for a long while without any sign of enemy presence, thunderous battle cries suddenly erupted from the West Gate—Shi Lang's main army had already breached the city.

